	(text "L2: 1 uH value retained; exact part and saturation/thermal rating MUST be selected\nagainst programmed boost current limit before assembly. PCB footprint is unverified.\nPVDD capacitors: verify effective capacitance under DC bias. BTL outputs: neither is GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 337.058 120.142 0)
		(effects
