	)
	(text "CONTROL: U3 TAS2120 = 0x49; U2 TAS2320 = 0x4A (7-bit I2C).\nIOVDD = 3.3 V; core VDD remains 1.8 V. SDZ defaults LOW.\nFirmware: release U2 secondary before U3 primary; establish clocks and\nobserve datasheet startup delays (at least 300 us where specified)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
